# English Learning Tool — 月度维护 job（膨胀检查 + 月度长期快照，oneshot，由 timer 触发）
[Unit]
Description=English Learning monthly maintenance job

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/english-learning/app/apps/api
EnvironmentFile=/etc/english-learning/env
ExecStart=/opt/english-learning/app/apps/api/node_modules/.bin/tsx src/jobs/monthly-maintenance.ts
